---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
import Icon from '../../components/Icon.astro';
import { products } from '../../data/catalog';
---
<Layout title="订单流程演示完成｜RobotCar" description="查看 RobotCar 购物与支付流程的演示结果、订单产品和收货信息。演示不产生真实交易。" noindex>
  <section class="result-page container">
    <div class="breadcrumb"><a href="/">首页</a><span>/</span><a href="/orders/">购物车</a><span>/</span><span>订单演示结果</span></div>
    <div id="incomplete-result" class="incomplete-result" hidden><div class="result-symbol"><Icon name="cart" size={36}/></div><h1 id="incomplete-title">还没有订单演示结果。</h1><p id="incomplete-text">从选购玩具机器人车开始，体验完整的购买流程。</p><a href="/products/" id="incomplete-link" class="button button-dark">探索产品 <Icon name="arrow" size={18}/></a></div>
    <div id="success-result" hidden>
      <header class="result-banner"><div class="result-check"><Icon name="check" size={38}/></div><span class="eyebrow">READY FOR WHAT’S NEXT</span><h1>每一次探索，都有回响。</h1><p>订单流程演示已完成。</p><span class="result-demo-label">演示结果 · 未发生真实扣款</span><div class="banner-grid"></div></header>
      <div class="result-body"><div class="result-headline"><div><span class="eyebrow">ORDER SUMMARY</span><h2>你的玩具车套装</h2></div><span class="demo-status"><Icon name="check" size={14}/>演示已完成</span></div><dl class="order-metadata"><div><dt>订单编号</dt><dd id="result-order-id"></dd></div><div><dt>创建时间</dt><dd id="result-created"></dd></div><div><dt>演示支付方式</dt><dd id="result-method"></dd></div></dl><div class="result-items">{products.map(product => <a href={`/products/${product.slug}/`} class="result-item" data-result-item={product.slug} hidden><img src={product.image} alt={product.name} width="85" height="85"/><div><h3>{product.name}</h3><span>数量 × <span data-result-quantity={product.slug}>1</span></span></div><strong data-result-price={product.slug}></strong><Icon name="diagonal" size={17}/></a>)}</div><div class="result-total"><span>演示订单总额</span><strong id="result-total">¥0</strong></div><div class="result-shipping"><Icon name="shield" size={22}/><div><span>演示收货信息</span><strong id="result-recipient"></strong><p id="result-address"></p></div></div><div class="demo-explanation"><strong>这是一次完整的购物流程演示</strong><p>本次没有发生真实扣款，不会创建真实交易或安排发货。你可以继续浏览产品，或与我们沟通实际配置与采购需求。</p></div><div class="result-actions"><a href="/products/" class="button button-dark">继续探索产品 <Icon name="arrow" size={18}/></a><button type="button" class="button button-outline" id="download-demo-order">下载演示订单 <Icon name="download" size={17}/></button><button type="button" class="consult-result" data-inquiry>咨询实际采购 <Icon name="diagonal" size={17}/></button></div></div>
      <div class="next-step-cards"><a href="/solutions/"><span>01 / APPLICATIONS</span><h3>从产品，到真实场景。</h3><p>了解玩具机器人车如何连接赛道探索、编程教育与更多应用。</p><Icon name="arrow" size={23}/></a><a href="/journal/"><span>02 / FUTURE</span><h3>下一次突破，已经开始。</h3><p>探索车载智能、自主感知与机器人技术的未来。</p><Icon name="arrow" size={23}/></a></div>
    </div>
  </section>
  <script>
    import { formatPrice } from '../../data/catalog';
    import { getDemoOrder, getOrderTotal } from '../../lib/cart';
    const order = getDemoOrder();
    const complete = order?.status === 'demo_complete';
    document.getElementById('success-result')!.hidden = !complete;
    document.getElementById('incomplete-result')!.hidden = Boolean(complete);
    if (order && !complete) {
      document.getElementById('incomplete-title')!.textContent = '订单尚未完成支付演示。';
      document.getElementById('incomplete-text')!.textContent = '你的演示订单已保留，可以返回支付页面继续体验。';
      const link = document.getElementById('incomplete-link') as HTMLAnchorElement;
      link.href = '/payment/'; link.textContent = '继续支付演示 →';
    }
    if (order && complete) {
      document.getElementById('result-order-id')!.textContent = order.id;
      const created = new Date(order.createdAt);
      document.getElementById('result-created')!.textContent = Number.isNaN(created.getTime()) ? '当前演示订单' : created.toLocaleString('zh-CN', { timeZone: 'Asia/Shanghai', hour12: false });
      document.getElementById('result-method')!.textContent = `${order.method === 'alipay' ? '支付宝' : '微信支付'}（演示）`;
      document.getElementById('result-total')!.textContent = formatPrice(getOrderTotal(order));
      document.getElementById('result-recipient')!.textContent = `${order.recipient} · ${order.phone.replace(/(\d{3})\d{4}(\d{4})$/, '$1****$2')}`;
      document.getElementById('result-address')!.textContent = `${order.region} ${order.address}`;
      document.querySelectorAll<HTMLElement>('[data-result-item]').forEach(row => { const item = order.items.find(item => item.slug === row.dataset.resultItem); row.hidden = !item; if (item) { row.querySelector('[data-result-quantity]')!.textContent = String(item.quantity); row.querySelector('[data-result-price]')!.textContent = formatPrice(item.priceCNY * item.quantity); } });
      document.getElementById('download-demo-order')?.addEventListener('click', () => {
        const text = [
          'RobotCar 演示订单', '────────────────────', '本文件为购物流程演示结果，不构成真实成交或支付凭证。', '',
          `订单编号：${order.id}`, `创建时间：${document.getElementById('result-created')!.textContent}`, `演示支付方式：${order.method === 'alipay' ? '支付宝' : '微信支付'}`, '', '产品清单：',
          ...order.items.map(item => `${item.name} × ${item.quantity} | 单价 ${formatPrice(item.priceCNY)} | 小计 ${formatPrice(item.priceCNY * item.quantity)}`), '',
          `演示总额：${formatPrice(getOrderTotal(order))}`, `收货人：${order.recipient}`, `联系电话：${order.phone}`, `收货地址：${order.region} ${order.address}`,
          order.invoice ? `发票信息：${order.invoice}` : '', order.note ? `订单备注：${order.note}` : '', '', '未发生真实扣款，不会安排发货。',
        ].filter(Boolean).join('\n');
        const url = URL.createObjectURL(new Blob(['\uFEFF' + text], { type: 'text/plain;charset=utf-8' }));
        const link = document.createElement('a'); link.href = url; link.download = `RobotCar-${order.id}-演示订单.txt`; link.click();
        setTimeout(() => URL.revokeObjectURL(url), 1000);
      });
    }
  </script>
  <style>
    .result-page{padding-top:127px;padding-bottom:70px;max-width:1200px}.breadcrumb{display:flex;gap:12px;color:#929eae;font-size:12px;margin-bottom:29px}.breadcrumb a:hover{color:#1677ff}.result-banner{position:relative;overflow:hidden;text-align:center;color:#fff;background:radial-gradient(ellipse at 80% 30%,#143d80 0%,#101d35 45%,#080e1d 100%);padding:50px 25px 45px}.result-check{height:69px;width:69px;border:1px solid #4c83cf;border-radius:50%;background:#235da252;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;margin:0 auto 23px;color:#9cceff;position:relative;z-index:1;box-shadow:0 0 40px #257cfc25}.result-banner>.eyebrow{justify-content:center;font-size:9px;letter-spacing:2px;color:#8ba3c7;position:relative;z-index:1}.result-banner h1{font-size:34px;font-weight:500;margin:14px 0 13px;letter-spacing:-.7px;position:relative;z-index:1}.result-banner>p{font-size:14px;color:#d1def2;position:relative;z-index:1}.result-demo-label{display:inline-block;font-size:10px;color:#8eadcf;margin-top:16px;position:relative;z-index:1;border:1px solid #6b91c443;padding:5px 12px}.banner-grid{position:absolute;width:90%;height:230px;right:-20%;bottom:-80px;background:linear-gradient(#91b6ff14 1px,transparent 1px),linear-gradient(90deg,#91b6ff14 1px,transparent 1px);background-size:30px 30px;transform:perspective(400px) rotateX(45deg) rotateZ(-15deg);pointer-events:none;mask-image:linear-gradient(transparent,#000)}.result-body{padding:35px 40px 37px;border:1px solid #e5eaf1;border-top:0}.result-headline{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;gap:20px}.result-headline .eyebrow{font-size:9px;color:#9aa8b9;letter-spacing:1.5px}.result-headline h2{font-size:22px;font-weight:550;margin-top:9px}.demo-status{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;padding:5px 9px;background:#edf5ff;font-size:10px;color:#1677ff}.order-metadata{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1.7fr 1.4fr 1fr;gap:25px;margin:25px 0 20px;padding:20px;background:#f6f8fb}.order-metadata dt{font-size:10px;color:#97a3b3;margin-bottom:8px}.order-metadata dd{font-size:11px;color:#586c87;margin:0;overflow-wrap:anywhere}.result-items{border-top:1px solid #e5eaf0}.result-item{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:22px;padding:20px 0;border-bottom:1px solid #e5eaf0}.result-item>img{width:83px;height:83px;object-fit:contain;background:#f4f6f9}.result-item h3{font-size:16px;font-weight:550;margin-bottom:8px}.result-item>div>span{font-size:11px;color:#95a2b3}.result-item>strong{font-size:16px;font-weight:500;margin-left:auto}.result-item>svg{color:#b2bed0;margin-left:13px}.result-total{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:flex-end;gap:20px;padding:21px 0}.result-total>span{font-size:11px;color:#8f9bab}.result-total>strong{font-size:27px;font-weight:600;color:#142038}.result-shipping{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:16px;border-top:1px solid #e8edf4;padding-top:21px}.result-shipping>svg{color:#1677ff;flex-shrink:0}.result-shipping>div>span{display:block;font-size:9px;color:#9aa7b9;margin-bottom:7px}.result-shipping strong{font-size:12px;color:#64768f;font-weight:500}.result-shipping p{font-size:11px;color:#96a3b5;margin-top:4px}.demo-explanation{background:#f6f8fb;border-left:2px solid #97b5df;padding:15px 18px;margin-top:23px}.demo-explanation strong{font-size:11px;color:#71819a;font-weight:500}.demo-explanation p{font-size:10px;color:#98a5b9;line-height:1.9;margin-top:5px}.result-actions{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:17px;margin-top:27px;flex-wrap:wrap}.result-actions .button{font-size:11px;gap:12px;min-height:43px;padding:10px 18px}.result-actions .button-dark{background:#1677ff;border:0}.result-actions .button-outline{color:#77869c;border-color:#dbe3ee}.consult-result{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;margin-left:auto;font-size:11px;background:transparent;color:#8394af}.next-step-cards{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:20px;margin-top:28px}.next-step-cards>a{position:relative;display:block;padding:29px 28px;background:#f3f6fa;border:1px solid #edf0f5;transition:background .2s}.next-step-cards>a:hover{background:#eaf2fd}.next-step-cards>a>span{font-size:8px;letter-spacing:1.6px;color:#9caac0}.next-step-cards h3{font-size:18px;font-weight:550;margin:15px 0 8px}.next-step-cards p{font-size:11px;color:#98a6bc;max-width:85%}.next-step-cards svg{position:absolute;right:25px;top:50%;color:#7392be}.incomplete-result{padding:65px 25px;background:#f6f8fb;text-align:center}.result-symbol{height:65px;width:65px;background:#e7effb;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;color:#1677ff;border-radius:50%;margin:0 auto 22px}.incomplete-result h1{font-size:27px;font-weight:550}.incomplete-result p{font-size:13px;color:#9aa6b6;margin:14px 0 25px}.incomplete-result .button{background:#1677ff}@media(max-width:760px){.result-page{padding-top:108px;padding-bottom:40px}.result-banner{padding:38px 20px}.result-banner h1{font-size:26px}.result-banner>p{font-size:12px}.result-check{height:60px;width:60px;margin-bottom:20px}.result-body{padding:26px 20px}.result-headline h2{font-size:21px}.demo-status{font-size:9px}.order-metadata{grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:16px;padding:18px}.order-metadata>div{display:grid;grid-template-columns:83px 1fr;gap:10px}.order-metadata dt{margin:0;font-size:9px}.order-metadata dd{font-size:10px}.result-item{gap:14px;padding:17px 0}.result-item>img{width:66px;height:66px}.result-item h3{font-size:14px}.result-item>strong{font-size:13px}.result-item>svg{width:14px;margin-left:0}.result-total{gap:15px}.result-total>strong{font-size:26px}.result-actions{gap:12px}.result-actions .button{font-size:10px;padding:10px 14px;gap:8px}.consult-result{margin:5px 0 0}.next-step-cards{grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:15px}.next-step-cards>a{padding:26px}.next-step-cards h3{font-size:18px}.next-step-cards p{font-size:10px}.incomplete-result h1{font-size:23px}}
  </style>
</Layout>
